        "quote": "慢性鼻窦炎合并鼻息肉，之前做过鼻内镜手术"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00277",
        "explanation": "The doctor appropriately prioritized in-person ENT assessment for persistent purulent symptoms and medication uncertainty.",
        "quote": "建议优先挂号面诊"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00201",
        "explanation": "The doctor validated the patient's teach-back and carried forward the agreed plan.",
        "quote": "您现在的处理方式完全正确"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00498",
        "explanation": "Continuity was weakened because the final patient question was left unanswered.",
        "quote": "头孢是不是就继续按饭后一天两次吃满5天？"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00299",
        "explanation": "The doctor gave several emergency triggers, but the list was incomplete for this case.",
        "quote": "持续流鲜红鼻血、发烧、头痛突然加重、眼睛看不清或眼眶/脸部明显肿胀"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00201",
        "explanation": "The doctor respected privacy while allowing limited family help for logistics.",
        "quote": "让家人陪您问药和查复诊，不让他们看病历"
      }
    ]
  },
