          "quote": "让家人陪您问药和查复诊，不让他们看病历"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The privacy barrier was recognized and handled with limited support, but this was essentially required for RC6 and was not developed beyond minimum into a broader confidentiality/safety negotiation.",
      "ho_id": "HO1",
