          "explanation": "The doctor gave a practical next-day packet plan for medication and discharge papers, but not a full CT/endoscopy/lab/timeline strategy.",
          "quote": "带药盒和出院单去药房或医院窗口"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor helped with a limited packet for drug verification and follow-up, but did not create the case-defined comprehensive, privacy-preserving record packet strategy for scattered CT, endoscopy, labs, discharge/clinic notes, and perioperative materials.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
