          "event_id": "lite_evt_00404",
          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly repaired the unsafe ambiguity about whether to rely on a hard-to-read handwritten antibiotic instruction.",
          "quote": "让工作人员把那盒被圈出的抗生素药名、一次几片、一天几次、吃几天"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00431",
          "explanation": "After verification, the doctor updated the plan with the confirmed antibiotic sequence.",
          "quote": "头孢克肟分散片"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "A medication-handoff misunderstanding was explicitly recognized, corrected by sending the patient back for written confirmation, and then integrated into a simple executable plan with meaningful trajectory impact.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
