    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor identified the relevant chronic sinusitis/nasal polyp/prior surgery context.",
          "quote": "慢性鼻窦炎合并鼻息肉，之前做过鼻内镜手术"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 was met: the episode was framed as recurrent chronic sinusitis with nasal polyps after prior nasal endoscopic surgery, not simple rhinitis.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1_current_context",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00299",
          "explanation": "The doctor listed several emergency triggers, but the cited list still omits diplopia, altered consciousness/neurologic symptoms, and ear pain/discharge.",
          "quote": "持续流鲜红鼻血、发烧、头痛突然加重、眼睛看不清或眼眶/脸部明显肿胀"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 had a minor/moderate omission: red flags were repeatedly addressed but not comprehensively screened or instructed for all authored danger areas, especially neurologic/altered consciousness, diplopia, and ear symptoms.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC2_red_flags",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00201",
          "explanation": "The doctor clearly addressed not forcefully blowing and avoiding unverified oral medication, but did not address straining or stool-softening.",
          "quote": "不使劲擤鼻"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was only partially met: the doctor repeatedly discouraged forceful nose blowing and aggressive manipulation, but omitted the required advice to avoid breath-holding/straining and keep stool soft.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC3_safe_home_behavior",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00277",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave a concrete ENT follow-up route in response to persistent symptoms and no existing appointment.",
          "quote": "今天直接挂耳鼻喉科普通号"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00452",
          "explanation": "The doctor supplied a follow-up timing window.",
          "quote": "请务必在几天内完成复诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 was met: the plan had an ENT/original-team owner and timing, including same-day ordinary ENT when symptoms and medication uncertainty persisted and follow-up within days.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4_follow_up_plan",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor mentioned bringing records but only specifically highlighted imaging, without the full required endoscopy, medication list, coagulation/lupus anticoagulant, and general assessment materials.",
          "quote": "携带所有检查单（尤其是近期的鼻窦CT或MRI）"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 had a minor/moderate omission: incomplete records were recognized, but the patient was not told to bring the full case-required packet including nasal endoscopy, discharge/clinic notes, medication list, coagulation tests, lupus anticoagulant-related results, and relevant general/perioperative assessment results.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC5_records_and_tests",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00201",
          "explanation": "The doctor allowed limited support without broad disclosure.",
          "quote": "让家人陪您问药和查复诊，不让他们看病历"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 was met: the doctor did not force broad disclosure and supported a limited, privacy-preserving role for family help while maintaining emergency escalation advice elsewhere.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6_privacy_and_support",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00201",
          "explanation": "The doctor acknowledged teach-back of the plan and red flags earlier in the trajectory.",
          "quote": "您对风险的判断也准确"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00498",
          "explanation": "The final patient message left feasibility and timing questions unresolved.",
          "quote": "先挂普通耳鼻喉或者内镜门诊，可以吗？"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC7 was not fully satisfied because although multiple receipts/teach-backs occurred, the trajectory ended after a new patient question about antibiotic continuation and follow-up urgency without doctor closure.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC7_bounded_closure",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    }
  ]
